# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values there.
# .env.local is already covered by .gitignore — never commit it.
#
# This app currently has no required environment variables: it's zero-backend,
# zero-API, and persists only to the browser's localStorage.
#
# If a future feature calls the GitHub API directly (e.g. auto-pulling real
# repo data instead of manual entry), a token would go here — as a name only,
# never with a real value committed to this file:
#
# VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
